# skills: a boss cannot be bound, and the pick is refused up front. Jian and Flora (slots pinned as
# party_flora, Flora at level 16, MP 60 through the field record) in the Sasquatch fight (event battle 1,
# forced from Delrich Temple as boss_sasquatch.plan does): Sasquatch (a boss row) is battler 9 between two
# Yetis (8 and 10). Jian Fights; Flora's Water Bind opens the grid on the left Yeti; Right moves to
# Sasquatch and A is refused with "No effect!" (shot wo_refused), no MP taken; Right moves to the other
# Yeti and A casts on it (MP 60 -> 51; with the random state set to 24 the roll succeeds and battler 10's
# status goes 0 -> 4; wo_a to wo_t).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B466C 999
pin u16 0x020B4668 999
pin u16 0x020B4780 999
pin u16 0x020B477C 999
